<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .line-input {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;">
    <h1 style="margin-top: 10px;">Cleveland State University</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.2em;">engagedlearning®</p>
  </div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">OFFICE OF DISABILITY SERVICES</h2>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Student Name:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="student_name" class="line-input">{{ student_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">CSU ID:</div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">
        <span data-field="csu_id" class="line-input">{{ csu_id }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">DOB:</div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">
        <span data-field="dob" class="line-input">{{ dob }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>I am requesting disability support services through the Office of Disability Services (ODS) at Cleveland State University. The department requires current and comprehensive documentation of my disability/medical condition as one of the criteria used to evaluate my eligibility for disability related accommodations and services. Please respond to the following questions as soon as possible. Once complete, you can return the document to me directly or submit it to ODS via email or fax. I authorize the Office of Disability Services to contact you if clarification is required.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Student signature:</div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">
        <span data-field="student_signature" class="line-input">{{ student_signature }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">Date:</div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">
        <span data-field="date_signature" class="line-input">{{ date_signature }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Health Care Provider Name (print):</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="provider_name" class="line-input">{{ provider_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Title:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="provider_title" class="line-input">{{ provider_title }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Phone:</div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        <span data-field="phone_number" class="line-input">{{ phone_number }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 15%;">EXT:</div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        <span data-field="extension" class="line-input">{{ extension }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">Fax:</div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">
        <span data-field="fax_number" class="line-input">{{ fax_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Organization:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="organization_name" class="line-input">{{ organization_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Mail address:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="mailing_address" class="line-input">{{ mailing_address }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-weight: bold;">Note to Providers:</h3>
    <p>The information that you provide will <strong>NOT</strong> become part of the student's educational record(s), but it will be kept in the student's file at ODS, where it will be held strictly confidential.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.9em;">Mailing Address: {{ mailing_address_static }}</p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">Campus Location: {{ campus_location_static }}</p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">Telephone: {{ phone_static }} &bull; Fax: {{ fax_static }}</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3 style="font-weight: bold;">The following information must be completed by the health care professional listed on the previous page.</h3>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Physician's name (print):</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="physician_name" class="line-input">{{ physician_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Date:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="date_physician" class="line-input">{{ date_physician }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Student's name:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="student_name_provider" class="line-input">{{ student_name_provider }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Date of last visit:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="date_last_visit" class="line-input">{{ date_last_visit }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>1. Diagnoses:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="diagnosis_1" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ diagnosis_1 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>2. Date of diagnoses:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="date_of_diagnoses" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ date_of_diagnoses }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>3. For environmental allergies, please list specific allergens:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="environmental_allergens" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ environmental_allergens }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>4. Please indicate severity of environmental allergies for this student:</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="radio" name="allergy_severity" value="mild"> a. Mild</label><br>
      <label><input type="radio" name="allergy_severity" value="moderate"> b. Moderate</label><br>
      <label><input type="radio" name="allergy_severity" value="severe"> c. Severe</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>5. Recommendations to the student for allergy management:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="allergy_recommendations" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ allergy_recommendations }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>6. For Asthma, it is:</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="radio" name="asthma_severity" value="mild_intermittent"> a. Mild intermittent</label><br>
      <label><input type="radio" name="asthma_severity" value="mild_persistent"> b. Mild persistent</label><br>
      <label><input type="radio" name="asthma_severity" value="moderate_persistent"> c. Moderate persistent</label><br>
      <label><input type="radio" name="asthma_severity" value="severe_persistent"> d. Severe persistent</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>7. Please describe what specifically induces asthma attacks for this student:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="asthma_triggers" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ asthma_triggers }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>8. Recommendations to the student for asthma management:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="asthma_management_recommendations" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ asthma_management_recommendations }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>9. For food allergies, please list specific allergens:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="food_allergens" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ food_allergens }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>10. The following exposures will trigger a food allergy reaction for the student:</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="exposure_airborne"> a. Airborne particles</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="exposure_skin"> b. Skin contact</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="exposure_ingestion"> c. Ingestion</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="exposure_cross_contact"> d. Cross-contact</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="exposure_other"> e. Other (please describe below):</label>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 10px;">
      <span data-field="exposure_other_description" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ exposure_other_description }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>11. The food allergies trigger the following reactions:</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="reaction_anaphylaxis"> a. Anaphylaxis</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="reaction_angioedema"> b. Angioedema</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="reaction_rash"> c. Rash</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="reaction_gastrointestinal"> d. Gastrointestinal symptoms</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="reaction_other"> e. Other (please explain):</label>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 10px;">
      <span data-field="reaction_other_explanation" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ reaction_other_explanation }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>12. Procedures/assessments used to diagnose (please attach copies of assessment results used in making/ confirming diagnosis):</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="procedure_spirometry"> a. Spirometry</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="procedure_allergy_testing"> b. Allergy Testing</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="procedure_evaluation"> c. Evaluation by allergy/asthma specialist</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="procedure_other"> d. Other (please explain):</label>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 10px;">
      <span data-field="procedure_other_description" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ procedure_other_description }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>13. Check the following that apply to this student:</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="check_emergency_room"> a. Was treated in the emergency room for this condition within the last year</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="check_inpatient_treatment"> b. Has received in-patient treatment for this condition within the last year</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="check_prescribed_allergy_shots"> c. Prescribed allergy shots</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="check_prescribed_rescue_inhaler"> d. Prescribed short acting rescue inhaler</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="check_epinephrine"> e. Uses an epinephrine pen (i.e. Epi-pen)</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="check_oral_maintenance"> f. Recommended to use oral maintenance medications (including antihistamines, leukotriene inhibitors)</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="check_inhaled_maintenance"> g. Prescribed inhaled maintenance medications (including steroids, combined beta agonists)</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>14. Describe how the above condition(s) substantially limits a major life activity, and the condition(s) impact(s) on the student's daily life experience in the post-secondary setting (academics, communal living/dining, recreation):</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 100px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="life_activity_impact" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ life_activity_impact }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>15. Recommendations for health care and symptom management for the above condition while on campus:</p>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 100px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
      <span data-field="campus_management_recommendations" style="display: block; height: 100%;">{{ campus_management_recommendations }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>This information is current and accurate to the best of my knowledge based on my recent evaluation of this patient or my review of records of a recent evaluation by a qualified health care provider.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Signature of Health Care Provider:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="provider_signature" class="line-input">{{ provider_signature }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Printed Name:</div>
      <div style="width: 65%;">
        <span data-field="provider_printed_name" class="line-input">{{ provider_printed_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">License #:</div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">
        <span data-field="provider_license_number" class="line-input">{{ provider_license_number }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">Date:</div>
      <div style="width: 35%;">
        <span data-field="date_provider_signature" class="line-input">{{ date_provider_signature }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Thank you for your assistance. You may return your report to the Office of Disability Services via email at {{ ods_email_static }} or by fax at {{ ods_fax_static }}.</p>
    <p>Please call {{ ods_phone_static }} if you require additional information. Please attach any additional reports or relevant information (audiology reports, neuropsychological evaluations, etc). All information on this form will remain confidential in accordance with the Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act (FERPA).</p>
  </div>
</div>